{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17597","headline":"和萧侍御监祭白帝城西村寺斋沐览镜有怀吏部孟员外幷见赠 · 羊士谔","name":"和萧侍御监祭白帝城西村寺斋沐览镜有怀吏部孟员外幷见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晚沐金仙宇，迎秋白帝祠。\n轩裳烦吏职，风物动心期。\n清镜开尘匣，华簪指发丝。\n南宫有高步，岁晏岂磷缁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊士谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17597.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17597","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}